<title>UK: TENNIS-NOTTINGHAM OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NOTTINGHAM OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results at the Nottingham Open men's grass-court tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Grant Stafford (South Africa) 3-6 6-3 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 4-6 6-2 7-5  </p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) 6-4 7-6 (7-4)  </p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 7-6 (7-5) 4-6 7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
